# Stage 02 — Split into chapters

Tasks:
1. Call `split_chapters`. It writes `chapters/src/{NNN_slug}.md` and
   `source/toc.json`, and advances state to SOURCE_SPLIT.
2. Read `source/toc.json` and sanity-check the chapter list: confirm no obvious
   front/back-matter scaffolding leaked in as a "chapter", and that chapter count
   looks right for the book.

Exit condition: `chapters/src/` contains one Markdown file per chapter and
`source/toc.json` exists.
